## The software being packaged

**ChurchCRM** is the work of the ChurchCRM contributors.

- Project: <https://github.com/churchcrm/crm>
- Website: <https://churchcrm.io>
- License: MIT — `Copyright (c) 2023 ChurchCRM`, reproduced verbatim in
